  "section_ordinal": 30,
  "caption": "Table 2 :",
  "cells": [
   {
    "row": 0,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "ReAct vs. CoT On the other hand, ReAct outperforms CoT on Fever (60.9 vs. 56.3) and slightly",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 142,
     "end": 234
    },
    "digest": "e4d8a39b5de55310369d6aea19fefbcd807d95e49f06bc1ec195ceb295e8b468"
   },
   {
    "row": 1,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "lags behind CoT on HotpotQA (27.4 vs. 29.4). Fever claims for SUPPORTS/REFUTES might only",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 234,
     "end": 323
    },
    "digest": "541a0f607bfd54f5512ce2f5e776c1be7d83bab6a2aa902aa0ac07e73d9890d6"
   },
   {
    "row": 2,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "differ by a slight amount (see Appendix D.1), so acting to retrieve accurate and up-to-date knowledge",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 323,
     "end": 424
    },
    "digest": "32af139b86e4c3c37d98465a62c7860910902baa64758d23ba851462f3f20226"
   },
   {
    "row": 3,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "is vital. To better understand the behavioral difference between ReAct and CoT on HotpotQA, we",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 424,
     "end": 518
    },
    "digest": "ec09678e20950c7791a3fc3244e28721406e28e5edd3dd1315c2d208a5f2f8da"
   },
   {
    "row": 4,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "randomly sampled 50 trajectories with correct and incorrect answers (judged by EM) from ReAct",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 518,
     "end": 611
    },
    "digest": "a58d4e8a711606ce863c93158d012865a91b1e2c70d07737981723aa9cf7f73a"
   },
   {
    "row": 5,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "and CoT respectively (thus 200 examples in total), and manually labeled their success and failure",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 611,
     "end": 708
    },
    "digest": "9e08598a6538fcc65b9e0d324ea84c240836685620a75e7c3f57518b5d369040"
   },
   {
    "row": 6,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "modes in Table 2. Some key observations are as follows:",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 708,
     "end": 763
    },
    "digest": "352ded102aa9ff0f6430ffadbc89905f958c8a7af39bb39b1d8d1287ec9642a3"
   }
  ],
  "source_digest": "4b2f488e6dd7ab0a38eeb147d353c32732df8697f7e5d49374017a38e5d2e60a",
  "missingness": null
 },
